Package: anonimax
Architecture: any
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, iptables, network-manager, procps, tor, systemd | systemctl, sudo, macchanger, isc-dhcp-client
Conflicts: anonsurf
Replaces: anonsurf
Recommends: bleachbit, tor-geoipdb
Suggests: obfs4proxy, snowflake-client
Description: Anonimax — extended anonymization toolkit
 Anonimax is an extended fork of AnonSurf that routes all system traffic
 through Tor and adds MAC address randomization, dhclient IP renewal,
 WebRTC blocking, telemetry blocking, timezone spoofing, panic mode,
 camera/microphone lockdown and upstream proxy support.

